    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2NWVTbVExUEVyME4wMm40ZEVXRnlBNWRfeEwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.4 春天还有比写生更美好的事吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64376c7366e4c00c6af56ee6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64376c7366e4c00c6af56ee6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Apr 2023 02:44:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，这里是我们的第四期节目，现在正值春暖花开的季节，气温也适宜，非常适合外出写生和晒太阳，像写生和日常的速写对于插画师来说，是记录灵感和提升画技好方法之一，所以这一期节目我邀请了两位有丰富写生和速写经验的插画师，大东和张张，来跟我们分享一下美好有趣的写生日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>写生工具材料的推荐及相关作品欣赏，请移步公众号【小钟老师的日常】搜索“插画爆米花”第四期搭配收听～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期快速通道】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 什么气候都阻止不了想写生的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 通常喜欢在哪画，画什么内容？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 社恐和非社恐的写生日常大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 写生不一定要写实的复原眼前所见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 给社恐人士的写生小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 面对多动的活物写生时该怎么处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">34:39</a> 写生好用的画材推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 面对不同内容写生经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3224">53:44</a> 令人印象深刻的写生记忆二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">62:05</a> 户外写生工具推荐，常见状况处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">67:15</a> 一人写生or团体写生效果有什么不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4580">76:20</a> 通过分享写生带来的工作机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4852">80:52</a> 电子写生和手绘写生的不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5347">89:07</a> 写生速写的避坑小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5617">93:37</a> 写生给我们的生活带了什么样的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小开心、钟小朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：@张张dt_zh（小红书同名）、大东酱（小红书同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制&amp;剪辑：小开心</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@钟钟插画工作室、@所谓钟小朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：小钟老师的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@所谓钟小朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：3512464860@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
